Author: anthnel <anthoni.devops@proton.me>
Date:   Tue Nov 10 12:37:25 2026 +0100

    refactor: split top-level views into Render and View and let the router own the terminal state (DEVDESK-201)

    Each top-level view keeps Render() string and exposes View() tea.View;
    app.Screen and a single setView (panics naming the view) replace the
    tea.Model map. Only App.View sets AltScreen, main.go and the setup wizard
    drop tea.WithAltScreen. Pastes are routed by handlePasteMsg. Tests move from
    View() to Render() where they read a view, and a few v1 test calls are ported.

    Entire-Checkpoint: cc03152e18e8

